OL,3,A'I never enjoyed exercise at school as
OL,4,AI was bullied' says DJ, ahead of
OL,5,A400-mile bike feat
OL,6,
OL,7,FRadio presenter Owain Wyn Evans has
OL,8,Fadmitted he "never enjoyed exercise at
OL,9,Fschool" because of bullying, ahead of
OL,10,Fhis four nations biking challenge for
OL,11,FChildren in Need.
OL,13,FThe host of BBC Radio 2's Early
OL,14,FBreakfast Show is set to cycle almost
OL,15,F400 miles over five days, setting off
OL,16,Ffrom Glasgow and finishing in Cardiff.
OL,18,FEvans, 42, who is originally from
OL,19,FAmmanford, Carmarthenshire, begins his
OL,20,Fchallenge in Scotland on 9 November,
OL,21,Fconcluding the 643km feat in the Welsh
OL,22,Fcapital on 13 November.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
